# Environment variables for the Beer Regatta site.
#
# This is a static marketing site with no forms, database, auth or payments,
# so NO runtime environment variables are currently required.
#
# This file documents the convention for when server-side features are added
# (e.g. a contact form that sends email). List variable NAMES ONLY here — never
# real values. Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in real values there.
#
# IMPORTANT: never prefix a secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that exposes it to the
# browser. Secrets must be read server-side via process.env only.
#
# Example (uncomment and adapt when a form/email provider is introduced):
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_FORM_TO_EMAIL=
